# Build context for the Docker images. The dev images copy only manifests and bind-mount the source,
# so this mainly matters for Docker/e2e-web.dockerfile, which copies the whole tree: the host's build
# output and git history have no place in it, and leaving them out keeps the context small.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
.git
**/.git
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
tests/OptiPowerTools.ScheduledJobsInsights.E2E/artifacts/
.env
